Built on Midnight (https://midnight.network).

AgePass is original work written for the Midnight Network Buildathon.
No source code was copied from other projects. The author studied the
following official Midnight resources (Apache-2.0, Copyright Midnight
Foundation / Input Output) to learn current patterns, and credits them here:

  * midnightntwrk/example-bboard
      - workspace layout and the in-memory contract simulator test pattern
  * midnightntwrk/example-zkloan
      - exact pinned dependency set, witness/private-state pattern,
        Midnight.js provider wiring, Lace (DApp Connector API) integration,
        local standalone devnet composition, private-state password rules
  * Midnight documentation (midnightntwrk/midnight-docs, docs.midnight.network)
      - "Keeping data private": HistoricMerkleTree membership proofs and the
        path.leaf binding check
      - Security best practices: "Restricting a circuit to a group"
      - Compact standard library and ledger ADT references
      - Networks and environments, compatibility (support) matrix
  * Election and private guest-list tutorials
      - domain-separated persistentHash keys derived from a local secret

